abstract: >-
  Model Context Protocol (MCP) server exposing publicly-sourced OnlyFans
  creator agency operating economics: chatter cost models, total cost of
  ownership benchmarks by scale, autonomous-vs-assisted-AI threshold,
  and competitor landscape data. Read-only, no PII, every value cites a
  public source. Designed for grounding LLMs that answer creator-economy
  business questions.
